  "solution": {
    "text": "Given that <math><mi></mi><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><msup><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math> ,<br /><math><mi>f</mi></math> is defined if <math><msup><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></math> or <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi></mi><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&lt;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi></mi></math> or <math><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>3</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi></mi><mi>x</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math> or <math><mi>x</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>4</mn></math><br />Hence, domain <math><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>∞</mi><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>∪</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mi>∞</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>"
